{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06749","headline":"送韦十二兵曹 · 王昌龄","name":"送韦十二兵曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"县职如长缨，终日检我身。\n平明趋郡府，不得展故人。\n故人念江湖，富贵如埃尘。\n迹在戎府掾，心游天台春。\n独立浦边鹤，白云长相亲。\n南风忽至吴，分散还入秦。\n寒夜天光白，海净月色真。\n对坐论岁暮，弦悲岂无因。\n平生驰驱分，非谓桮酒仁。\n出处两不合，忠贞何由伸。\n看君孤舟去，且欲歌垂纶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}